-- V226_Equip_Upgrade_Slot_Bonus.sql
-- GMS v271 gives every equip that could take a Golden Hammer one more upgrade slot (unscrolled equips arrive with
-- their data's slots + 1; exceptUpgrade items and Horntail Necklaces don't get it). New items get it from
-- EquipItemInfo.getFreshTuc(); this gives it once to the equips that already exist. The list is every non-cash equip
-- in the v271 data with slots, no exceptUpgrade, and not a Horntail Necklace.
